{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5001_p", "source_sha256": "0e26575d5496ca53459495cec08bfc1630624d1a638856de6dc3becf5b0b5f8e", "ja": "（今日は『アイドル抜き打ち学力テスト』の収録だ。\n前半戦は、琴葉が唯一の全問正解で終了した……）", "zh": "（今天要录制《偶像突击学力测试》。\n前半场结束时，琴叶成了唯一一个全部答对的人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5002_017kth", "source_sha256": "0bf9d6893d97275710b1acc152462342426c419234ebd70af8078eccfd98472b", "ja": "{$P$}、教えてください……。\n私、このままじゃダメなんでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，请告诉我……。\n我这样下去是不是不行呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5003_p", "source_sha256": "f8d0210ac60fb8840f6005b587c45075ad401f306a0c80a879456b16c83b6623", "ja": "えっ？　どうしたんだ急に？", "zh": "咦？怎么突然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5004_017kth", "source_sha256": "504331230355d1d43de9e2e21052db0532eb87baf229ad66781a6e522fbe0886", "ja": "その……収録をしていて気づいたんです。\n私、話にあまり参加できていなかったと思うんです。", "zh": "那个……录制的时候我注意到了。\n我好像没怎么参与到谈话中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5005_017kth", "source_sha256": "30d9c860669d0e4c4d4f339f5fe229ceb94a1a4203273a22c3700416d0930ef1", "ja": "面白い答えをした人達の話を聞いてる方が長くて……。\nもしかして正解するよりもいいのかなって。", "zh": "听那些给出有趣答案的人说话，时间反而更长……\n我就在想，说不定这比答对问题还要好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5006_p", "source_sha256": "2ddf5e401f22e605e20edae6841e98643ef9cdb5f4004e7be61e3f762d8c9fcc", "ja": "たしかに、こういう番組は、\n答えで笑いをとる人が多いかもしれない。", "zh": "确实，这种节目里，靠答案逗笑大家的人可能更多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5007_017kth", "source_sha256": "c7131e8944ad67c472db8042b714ad8ef664a2d12c9b0f1fb531d823f87c51af", "ja": "そうですよね……。やっぱり私も、\n面白い解答をした方がいいのかな。どう思いますか？", "zh": "是啊……我是不是也该给出有趣的答案呢？您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5008_p", "source_sha256": "717997f00c9fc5dcd30254802dcaed9b9512eb4823c70a107bd729f66c7f2a05", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5009", "source_sha256": "5344d68dba4f53e0cd021cc67c4e4b826710cb4091e53184a49e4381c20d70e9", "ja": "全問正解を目指す", "zh": "争取全部答对", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5010", "source_sha256": "23575e28dfc077eb139790f435d65e4d18dcaf55e93b54c3a8296d786379f467", "ja": "面白さも大事", "zh": "有趣也很重要", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5200_p", "source_sha256": "0950bef2ff16d44d40c56ac1f8f4e4bb87bdbeb0b9a844f22828937bc67447bb", "ja": "このまま全問正解を目指そう！\n面白い解答をするよりインパクトがあると思う。", "zh": "就这样奔着全部答对去吧！\n我觉得这比给出有趣的回答更有冲击力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5201_017kth", "source_sha256": "fae5ebbbfd3879b25bba216f77a2bc9c8da11a76a5658270609d4c6b5f144b1d", "ja": "よかったぁ。面白い解答ができるか少し不安で……。\n{$P$}が同じ考えで、安心しました。", "zh": "太好了。我之前还有点担心能不能给出有趣的回答……\n{$P$}也是这么想的，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5202_017kth", "source_sha256": "0f1dcd860b94445e9f27b3051c03a7e0e2da528a1090f45de79670e12fda0786", "ja": "後半は難易度が上がるそうですけど、任せてください！\n目指せ、全問正解！ですね……ふふっ♪", "zh": "后半部分的难度好像会提升，不过请交给我吧！\n目标是，全问正解！对吧……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5300_p", "source_sha256": "0950bef2ff16d44d40c56ac1f8f4e4bb87bdbeb0b9a844f22828937bc67447bb", "ja": "このまま全問正解を目指そう！\n面白い解答をするよりインパクトがあると思う。", "zh": "就这样奔着全部答对去吧！\n我觉得这比给出有趣的回答更有冲击力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5301_017kth", "source_sha256": "d29abbc9b2157eddc4f81ec8d6227571daf646af20ed894fdb50e678077d2da6", "ja": "た、たしかに……。他の人と同じことをしても、\n私自身のアピールにはなりませんね……。", "zh": "确、确实……就算和其他人做一样的事，也无法展现我自己呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5302_017kth", "source_sha256": "f86259b959364b949ad3b3a3fe8c2bbf840c50e580a9f623fbf546ac97374abc", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\n全問正解できるよう、参考書を読み直しておきます！", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n为了能答对所有问题，我会把参考书再重读一遍的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5500_p", "source_sha256": "f273540b3da38ca87136d05355744b9a64b013c9f581c2f56b6924daa4e84bac", "ja": "面白さも大事かもしれないな。でも、大丈夫か？\n正解するよりも難しいと思うけど……。", "zh": "趣味性可能也很重要吧。不过，你没问题吗？\n我觉得这比答对题目还要难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5501_017kth", "source_sha256": "9b7010ae70dd28976eeedf1b340f7cae415cbd978d54eaddffa120f5cfb08b19", "ja": "大丈夫です。実は、私に考えがあるんです！\n突然、おかしな解答をしても変に思われるので……。", "zh": "没问题的。其实，我心里有个想法！\n要是突然给出奇怪的回答，反而会让人觉得不对劲，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5502_017kth", "source_sha256": "8cf7f1f25c825458fde4ab98a99fd94878242f7bf0e7b1e5c58fd0b2a26af51d", "ja": "絵を描いてみるなんてどうでしょう！\n歴史上の人物や動物の問題が、絶好のチャンスです♪", "zh": "要不试着画画看吧！历史人物和动物之类的问题，正是绝佳的机会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5600_p", "source_sha256": "f273540b3da38ca87136d05355744b9a64b013c9f581c2f56b6924daa4e84bac", "ja": "面白さも大事かもしれないな。でも、大丈夫か？\n正解するよりも難しいと思うけど……。", "zh": "趣味性可能也很重要吧。不过，你没问题吗？\n我觉得这比答对题目还要难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5601_017kth", "source_sha256": "ae6650dbc4b3c7f4e037a2cd7288479e7b9d9df101133e3bcd66f2b8f0a19020", "ja": "うっ、そうですね。面白さ……面白さって何だろう？\nこういうのは奈緒ちゃんが得意で……あ、そっか！", "zh": "呃，说得也是。趣味性……趣味性到底是什么呢？\n这种事奈绪最擅长了……啊，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_5602_017kth", "source_sha256": "c135e24f5095dc7acc85f73fc87bfa7d3f75347518a630a365a7170ac126d604", "ja": "面白いことを言う人を演じれば……うん、いけるかも！\n後半戦、楽しみにしててくださいね♪", "zh": "只要扮演一个会说有趣话的人……嗯，或许可行！\n敬请期待下半场吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
